  <datafield tag="590" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Library's copy is signed in pencil and numbered 9/16 at foot of scroll and on verso. The case is numbered twice in pencil: 9/16, and branded "9" twice on the end bevels.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A photographically reproduced scroll of 6 panels, each with a pattern of dotted lines. The panels are dated from 12.2.1980 to 17.2.1980.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">In case made from a length of bamboo, split and hollowed out. The 2 halves are hinged together on 1 side by leather strips affixed with tacks. Extensions of the strips serve as ties. Case has fire-etched author and title: Cesi Amoretti  I sentieri della memoria  Bamboo-book 1981.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
